<p class="muted">Every investor receives the Owner role. For a new login, set a password and confirm their email directly. An existing verified Owner in this company keeps their current password; leave these fields empty to link that account.</p>
<label for="owner-password">Password for a new login</label>
<input id="owner-password" type="password" name="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" form="owner-login-form">
<label for="owner-password-confirmation">Confirm password</label>
<input id="owner-password-confirmation" type="password" name="password_confirmation" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" form="owner-login-form">
<label><input style="width:auto" type="checkbox" name="email_confirmed" value="1" form="owner-login-form"> I confirmed this email address directly with the investor.</label>
